OL,3,GNEWSAWorker who halted gas work called
OL,4,A'trouble-causer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen a gas company employee had used a
OL,7,Fsystem that stopped work they thought
OL,8,Fwas dangerous, they were seen as "a bit
OL,9,Fof a trouble-causer", a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FTen people died following the gas
OL,13,Fexplosion at the Haut du Mont flats in
OL,14,FSt Helier in the early hours of 10
OL,15,FDecember 2022.
OL,17,FThe jury heard evidence from Luke Le
OL,18,FBrocq, who was working for Island
OL,19,FEnergy with John Wright, 60, and Neil
OL,20,FArmstrong, 58, to disconnect a gas pipe
OL,21,Fthat serviced the flats in the days
OL,22,Fbefore the explosion.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
