OL,3,GNEWSAWorker who halted gas work called
OL,4,A'trouble-causer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGas workers Armstrong, Wright and Lee
OL,7,FWard, 59, deny 10 counts of gross
OL,8,Fnegligence manslaughter and Island
OL,9,FEnergy has also pleaded not guilty in a
OL,10,Fcombined health and safety case.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
